---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<PageLayout
  title={`Contact | ${SITE.brand}`}
  description={`Contact ${SITE.brand} by email to report a bug, suggest a tool or ask a question about our free browser-based tools.`}
  h1="Contact"
  path="/contact"
>
  <p>
    The best way to reach us is by email:
  </p>
  <p>
    <a class="btn" href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>Email {SITE.email}</a>
  </p>

  <h2>Reporting a problem</h2>
  <p>
    If a tool does not work as expected, please tell us which tool you used, what device and
    browser you were on, and what you saw (an error message or a screenshot helps).
  </p>
  <p>
    Please <strong>do not attach your private files</strong>. Because the tools run in your
    browser, we never see your files, and we do not need them to investigate most problems.
  </p>

  <h2>Suggesting a tool</h2>
  <p>
    Ideas for new tools are welcome. Let us know what you are trying to do and where you would
    use it.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
